{"id":"u28","kelas":10,"no":2,"judul":"Teks Deskriptif","title":"Descriptive Text","emoji":"🖼️","ringkas":"Mendeskripsikan orang, tempat, dan benda secara rinci","ready":true,"goals":["memahami struktur **descriptive text**: **Identification** dan **Description**","memakai **simple present** dan kata kerja penghubung ([[is]], [[looks]], [[seems]], [[feels]]) untuk mendeskripsikan","membedakan [[has / have]] (memiliki) dan [[is / are]] (keadaan) dalam deskripsi","menyusun beberapa kata sifat dengan urutan yang benar: [[a beautiful small old house]]","mendeskripsikan **orang**, **tempat**, dan **benda** dengan rinci","menulis paragraf deskriptif yang jelas dan hidup"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Bagaimana kamu menjelaskan sahabatmu kepada orang yang belum pernah bertemu dengannya? Atau indahnya sebuah pantai? Untuk itu kita memakai **descriptive text**. Tujuannya: **menggambarkan** ciri-ciri seseorang, tempat, atau benda sehingga pembaca bisa membayangkannya."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Struktur descriptive text","text":"Descriptive text punya dua bagian utama:","table":[["Bagian","Isi","Contoh"],["**Identification**","Memperkenalkan hal yang dideskripsikan: siapa atau apa itu","[[My best friend is Dina.]]"],["**Description**","Menjelaskan ciri-cirinya: penampilan, sifat, bagian, atau kegunaan","[[She is tall and slim. She has long black hair.]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Ciri kebahasaan","text":"Descriptive text biasanya memakai:","table":[["Ciri","Penjelasan","Contoh"],["**Simple present**","Karena menggambarkan keadaan yang tetap","[[The beach has white sand.]]"],["**Kata sifat** (adjectives)","Menjelaskan sifat atau penampilan","[[a friendly girl]], [[a quiet village]]"],["**Kata kerja penghubung**","is, are, looks, seems, feels, smells, tastes","[[The cake looks delicious.]]"],["**has / have**","Menyebut bagian atau ciri yang dimiliki","[[The house has a big garden.]]"],["**Kata benda spesifik**","Menyebut hal tertentu, bukan umum","[[my cat, Mimi]], [[Lake Toba]]"]]},{"t":"vocab","title":"3. Kata sifat untuk mendeskripsikan","items":[{"en":"slim","id":"langsing","ex":"She is tall and slim."},{"en":"curly","id":"keriting","ex":"He has curly hair."},{"en":"friendly","id":"ramah","ex":"My neighbor is very friendly."},{"en":"diligent","id":"rajin","ex":"Budi is a diligent student."},{"en":"generous","id":"dermawan / murah hati","ex":"My uncle is generous."},{"en":"crowded","id":"ramai / padat","ex":"The market is crowded on Sundays."},{"en":"peaceful","id":"tenang / damai","ex":"The village is peaceful."},{"en":"scenic","id":"berpemandangan indah","ex":"It is a scenic place."},{"en":"spacious","id":"luas / lega","ex":"The room is spacious."},{"en":"smooth","id":"halus / licin","ex":"The surface is smooth."},{"en":"rough","id":"kasar","ex":"The stone feels rough."},{"en":"durable","id":"awet / tahan lama","ex":"This bag is durable."},{"en":"lightweight","id":"ringan","ex":"The laptop is lightweight."},{"en":"delicious","id":"lezat","ex":"The soup tastes delicious."}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Urutan kata sifat","text":"Kalau memakai beberapa kata sifat sebelum kata benda, urutannya biasanya:","table":[["Urutan","Jenis","Contoh"],["1","Pendapat (opinion)","beautiful, nice, ugly"],["2","Ukuran (size)","big, small, tall, long"],["3","Usia (age)","old, new, young"],["4","Warna (color)","red, black, white"],["5","Asal (origin)","Indonesian, Japanese"],["6","Bahan (material)","wooden, leather, plastic"]],"examples":[{"en":"[[a beautiful small old house]]","id":"opinion → size → age → noun"},{"en":"[[a small black leather bag]]","id":"size → color → material → noun"},{"en":"[[a nice long white dress]]","id":"opinion → size → color → noun"}]},{"t":"grammar","title":"5. is/are dan has/have dalam deskripsi","text":"Gunakan **be** untuk keadaan atau sifat, dan **have/has** untuk bagian atau benda yang dimiliki.","table":[["Pola","Contoh"],["Subjek + **is/are** + kata sifat","[[She is tall.]] / [[They are friendly.]]"],["Subjek + **has/have** + kata benda","[[She has long hair.]] / [[The room has two windows.]]"],["Subjek + **looks/seems** + kata sifat","[[He looks tired.]] / [[The house seems old.]]"]]},{"t":"warn","title":"Jangan campur","text":"Benar: [[She is tall.]] dan [[She has long hair.]] Salah: *She has tall.* dan *She is long hair.*"},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 1: My Best Friend (mendeskripsikan orang)","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"My best friend is Dina. She is fifteen years old, and she lives next to my house. (Identification)","id":"Sahabatku adalah Dina. Dia berumur lima belas tahun, dan dia tinggal di sebelah rumahku."},{"who":"Text","en":"Dina is tall and slim. She has long black hair and brown eyes. She always wears a pink hijab to school.","id":"Dina tinggi dan langsing. Dia berambut hitam panjang dan bermata cokelat. Dia selalu memakai hijab merah muda ke sekolah. (Description: penampilan)"},{"who":"Text","en":"She is friendly and diligent. She helps me when I have difficulties with my homework, so I am lucky to have her as my friend.","id":"Dia ramah dan rajin. Dia membantuku saat aku kesulitan dengan PR, jadi aku beruntung memilikinya sebagai teman. (Description: sifat)"}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Teks 2: Lake Toba (mendeskripsikan tempat)","lines":[{"who":"Text","en":"Lake Toba is the largest volcanic lake in the world. It is located in North Sumatra, Indonesia. (Identification)","id":"Danau Toba adalah danau vulkanik terbesar di dunia. Letaknya di Sumatra Utara, Indonesia."},{"who":"Text","en":"The water is clear and cool. In the middle of the lake, there is a big island called Samosir. The air feels fresh, and the view is very beautiful.","id":"Airnya jernih dan sejuk. Di tengah danau terdapat pulau besar bernama Samosir. Udaranya terasa segar dan pemandangannya sangat indah. (Description)"},{"who":"Text","en":"Many tourists visit this scenic place every year. They enjoy swimming, taking photos, and trying local food.","id":"Banyak wisatawan mengunjungi tempat indah ini setiap tahun. Mereka menikmati berenang, berfoto, dan mencicipi makanan lokal."}]},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mencari teman di keramaian","lines":[{"who":"Tom","en":"Dina, have you seen Budi? I can't find him.","id":"Dina, apakah kamu melihat Budi? Aku tidak bisa menemukannya."},{"who":"Dina","en":"What does he look like?","id":"Dia terlihat seperti apa?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"He is tall and thin. He has short curly hair, and he wears a blue jacket.","id":"Dia tinggi dan kurus. Rambutnya pendek keriting, dan dia memakai jaket biru."},{"who":"Dina","en":"Oh, I think I saw him near the library. He looked tired.","id":"Oh, kurasa aku melihatnya dekat perpustakaan. Dia tampak lelah."}]},{"t":"tip","title":"Tunjukkan, jangan hanya menyebut","text":"Daripada menulis [[She is nice.]], beri detail: [[She always helps her friends and smiles to everyone.]] Detail membuat pembaca lebih mudah membayangkan."},{"t":"summary","items":["Struktur: **Identification** (siapa/apa) lalu **Description** (ciri-cirinya).","Memakai **simple present**, kata sifat, kata kerja penghubung ([[looks]], [[seems]], [[feels]]), dan [[has/have]].","Urutan kata sifat: opinion → size → age → color → origin → material.","[[is/are]] untuk keadaan; [[has/have]] untuk bagian atau benda yang dimiliki.","Beri detail yang spesifik supaya deskripsi hidup."]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["slim","langsing"],["friendly","ramah"],["crowded","ramai"],["durable","awet"],["rough","kasar"]],"exp":"Kata sifat ini sering dipakai dalam descriptive text.","k":"06a44ffd"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian descriptive text yang memperkenalkan hal yang dideskripsikan adalah...","options":["Description","Identification","Conclusion","Orientation"],"answer":1,"exp":"Identification memperkenalkan siapa atau apa yang dideskripsikan.","k":"39620a9f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tenses yang paling umum dalam descriptive text adalah...","options":["simple past","simple present","present perfect","future"],"answer":1,"exp":"Deskripsi menggambarkan keadaan yang tetap → simple present.","k":"5543cf59"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar: \"a ___ bag\"","options":["small black leather","leather small black","black small leather","small leather black"],"answer":0,"exp":"size → color → material.","k":"e5564751"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar.","options":["a wooden old beautiful table","a beautiful old wooden table","an old wooden beautiful table","a wooden beautiful old table"],"answer":1,"exp":"opinion → age → material.","k":"f7e347e7"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia mempunyai rambut panjang.","q":"She ___ long hair.","answers":["has"],"hint":"has / is ?","exp":"Menyebut ciri yang dimiliki → has.","k":"78d0b20e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka sangat ramah.","q":"They ___ very friendly.","answers":["are"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"They → are.","k":"b9190277"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kue itu terlihat lezat.","q":"The cake ___ delicious.","answers":["looks"],"hint":"look + s","exp":"looks = kata kerja penghubung (it → looks).","k":"900b12b9"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamar itu mempunyai dua jendela.","q":"The room ___ two windows.","answers":["has"],"hint":"has / have ?","exp":"The room (it) → has.","k":"40255a07"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has tall.","She is tall.","She have tall.","She are tall."],"answer":1,"exp":"Tall adalah kata sifat → is tall.","k":"2d83bebc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["The house have a big garden.","The house has a big garden.","The house is a big garden.","The house are a big garden."],"answer":1,"exp":"Memiliki taman → has.","k":"7ab8f483"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja manakah yang termasuk kata kerja penghubung?","options":["run","seem","write","buy"],"answer":1,"exp":"seem menghubungkan subjek dengan sifatnya.","k":"0dd8d8b0"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia tinggi dan langsing.\"","answer":"She is tall and slim.","exp":"Subjek + is + kata sifat.","k":"8cc9f5a0"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Pantai itu mempunyai pasir putih.\"","answer":"The beach has white sand.","exp":"Subjek + has + kata benda.","k":"da74fee7"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Udaranya terasa segar.\"","answer":"The air feels fresh.","exp":"feels = kata kerja penghubung.","k":"665ba499"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis kata sifat dengan contohnya:","pairs":[["pendapat","beautiful"],["ukuran","small"],["usia","old"],["bahan","wooden"]],"exp":"Opinion → size → age → color → origin → material.","k":"64f59509"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dideskripsikan?","say":"She has long black hair and brown eyes","options":["Rambut dan mata seseorang","Pakaian seseorang","Sebuah rumah","Sebuah makanan"],"answer":0,"exp":"hair dan eyes menunjukkan ciri fisik.","k":"871ebc43"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The village is quiet and peaceful","options":["Desa itu sepi dan damai","Desa itu besar dan ramai","Desa itu jauh dan gelap","Desa itu baru dan modern"],"answer":0,"exp":"quiet = sepi; peaceful = damai.","k":"9db44b95"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"He looks tired","options":["Dia tampak lelah","Dia tampak marah","Dia tampak senang","Dia tampak lapar"],"answer":0,"exp":"looks tired = tampak lelah.","k":"ac762e4f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rambutnya keriting.","q":"His hair ___ curly.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"His hair (it) → is.","k":"55e66178"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rumah itu terlihat tua.","q":"The house ___ old.","answers":["looks","seems"],"hint":"look / seem + s","exp":"looks atau seems = tampak.","k":"0a18a830"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kakakku mempunyai sepeda baru.","q":"My brother ___ a new bicycle.","answers":["has"],"hint":"has / have ?","exp":"My brother (he) → has.","k":"a1987d0a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Murid-murid itu rajin.","q":"The students ___ diligent.","answers":["are"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"The students (they) → are.","k":"e80fa529"},{"type":"fill","id":"Batu itu terasa kasar.","q":"The stone ___ rough.","answers":["feels"],"hint":"feel + s","exp":"feels = kata kerja penghubung.","k":"0a908846"},{"type":"fill","id":"Taman itu mempunyai banyak bunga.","q":"The garden ___ many flowers.","answers":["has"],"hint":"has / have ?","exp":"The garden (it) → has.","k":"15e69fde"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["My cat have soft fur.","My cat has soft fur.","My cat is soft fur.","My cat are soft fur."],"answer":1,"exp":"Memiliki bulu halus → has.","k":"580477e8"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar.","options":["a Japanese new car","a new Japanese car","a car new Japanese","a Japanese car new"],"answer":1,"exp":"age → origin.","k":"0d7cdac4"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar.","options":["a beautiful long dress","a long beautiful dress","a dress beautiful long","a long dress beautiful"],"answer":0,"exp":"opinion → size.","k":"61d9f497"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar.","options":["a plastic blue small bottle","a small blue plastic bottle","a blue small plastic bottle","a small plastic blue bottle"],"answer":1,"exp":"size → color → material.","k":"239f94a9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang berisi Identification?","options":["It has white walls and a red roof.","Borobudur is a Buddhist temple in Central Java.","The temple looks magnificent.","The air feels cool."],"answer":1,"exp":"Memperkenalkan objek dan letaknya.","k":"a5155251"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang berisi Description?","options":["My pet is a cat named Mimi.","Mimi has soft white fur and green eyes.","This text is about my cat.","I have a cat."],"answer":1,"exp":"Menjelaskan ciri fisik → Description.","k":"7a931611"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"The room is spacious\" berarti kamar itu...","options":["kecil","luas","gelap","kotor"],"answer":1,"exp":"spacious = luas.","k":"73c3078c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata \"peaceful\" paling tepat dipakai untuk...","options":["pasar yang ramai","desa yang tenang","jalan raya yang macet","pesta yang meriah"],"answer":1,"exp":"peaceful = tenang, damai.","k":"e7971528"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang tepat untuk mendeskripsikan sifat?","options":["He is generous.","He has generous.","He generous.","He are generous."],"answer":0,"exp":"Subjek + is + kata sifat.","k":"2adf3b2e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["The bag looks heavily.","The bag looks heavy.","The bag look heavy.","The bag is looks heavy."],"answer":1,"exp":"Setelah looks pakai kata sifat (heavy), bukan kata keterangan.","k":"de82dafe"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kucingku mempunyai bulu putih yang lembut.\"","answer":"My cat has soft white fur.","exp":"has + kata sifat + kata benda.","k":"268901dd"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Desa itu tenang dan indah.\"","answer":"The village is quiet and beautiful.","exp":"is + dua kata sifat.","k":"fd57739f"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia memakai jaket biru panjang.\"","answer":"He wears a long blue jacket.","exp":"size → color.","k":"7b8dc2d3"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Sup itu terasa lezat.\"","answer":"The soup tastes delicious.","exp":"tastes = kata kerja penghubung.","k":"91754504"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata dengan artinya:","pairs":[["curly","keriting"],["spacious","luas"],["smooth","halus"],["peaceful","damai"]],"exp":"Kata sifat untuk orang, tempat, dan benda.","k":"820f535c"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata kerja penghubung dengan artinya:","pairs":[["look","tampak"],["feel","terasa"],["smell","berbau"],["taste","berasa"]],"exp":"Kata kerja penghubung diikuti kata sifat.","k":"5e6df048"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa yang dideskripsikan?","say":"It has a big garden and two floors","options":["Sebuah rumah","Seorang guru","Sebuah makanan","Seekor hewan"],"answer":0,"exp":"garden dan floors menunjukkan rumah.","k":"b2e27b28"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The water is clear and cool","options":["Airnya jernih dan sejuk","Airnya keruh dan panas","Airnya dalam dan gelap","Airnya sedikit dan kotor"],"answer":0,"exp":"clear = jernih; cool = sejuk.","k":"4be100e7"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"My teacher is kind and patient","options":["Guruku baik hati dan sabar","Guruku galak dan tegas","Guruku muda dan lucu","Guruku sibuk dan lelah"],"answer":0,"exp":"kind = baik hati; patient = sabar.","k":"7bb88e77"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rambutnya panjang dan hitam.","q":"Her hair is long ___ black.","answers":["and"],"hint":"dan","exp":"and = dan.","k":"b65dc223"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rumah itu sangat besar.","q":"The house is very ___.","answers":["big","large"],"hint":"besar","exp":"big/large = besar.","k":"1cb67b55"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kucingku punya empat kaki.","q":"My cat ___ four legs.","answers":["has"],"hint":"have/has","exp":"My cat (it) → has.","k":"f72e3e7b"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kamarku bersih dan rapi.","q":"My room ___ clean and tidy.","answers":["is"],"hint":"to be","exp":"Deskripsi memakai simple present: is.","k":"f6e65978"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka punya mata cokelat.","q":"They ___ brown eyes.","answers":["have"],"hint":"have/has","exp":"they → have.","k":"8d9a8b1e"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pantai itu terkenal karena pasir putihnya.","q":"The beach is famous ___ its white sand.","answers":["for"],"hint":"karena/untuk","exp":"famous for = terkenal karena.","k":"440adbd4"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sekolahku terletak di tengah kota.","q":"My school is ___ in the center of the city.","answers":["located"],"hint":"terletak","exp":"located = terletak.","k":"d009c76a"},{"type":"fill","id":"Langit tampak biru dan cerah.","q":"The sky ___ blue and bright.","answers":["looks"],"hint":"tampak","exp":"looks = tampak.","k":"0018fd14"},{"type":"fill","id":"Wajahnya bulat dan ramah.","q":"He has a round and ___ face.","answers":["friendly"],"hint":"ramah","exp":"friendly = ramah.","k":"96c9e256"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks deskriptif bertujuan untuk...","options":["menggambarkan ciri orang/benda/tempat","menceritakan kejadian lampau","memberi instruksi","meyakinkan pembaca"],"answer":0,"exp":"Descriptive text menggambarkan.","k":"bdccb4bc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian pertama teks deskriptif adalah...","options":["identification","description","orientation","reorientation"],"answer":0,"exp":"Identification memperkenalkan objek.","k":"2af3166c"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense yang umum dipakai dalam teks deskriptif adalah...","options":["simple present","simple past","future perfect","past continuous"],"answer":0,"exp":"Simple present.","k":"e57f0f70"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang benar?","options":["She have long hair.","She has long hair.","She haves long hair.","She is have long hair."],"answer":1,"exp":"she → has.","k":"64434334"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Tall\" adalah lawan kata dari...","options":["short","long","big","fat"],"answer":0,"exp":"tall >< short.","k":"e34d8e48"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Urutan adjektiva yang benar:","options":["a small round wooden table","a wooden round small table","a round wooden small table","a table small round wooden"],"answer":0,"exp":"Ukuran – bentuk – bahan.","k":"a527ddf5"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"Enormous\" artinya...","options":["sangat besar","sangat kecil","sangat cepat","sangat lama"],"answer":0,"exp":"enormous = sangat besar.","k":"ba5df975"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata sifat untuk benda yang halus saat disentuh:","options":["smooth","rough","heavy","loud"],"answer":0,"exp":"smooth = halus.","k":"83f1ca87"},{"type":"mcq","q":"\"The lake is surrounded by mountains.\" artinya...","options":["Danau itu dikelilingi gunung.","Danau itu di atas gunung.","Gunung itu di danau.","Danau itu jauh dari gunung."],"answer":0,"exp":"surrounded by = dikelilingi.","k":"51357b46"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang mendeskripsikan sifat orang?","options":["He is kind and generous.","He is in the garden.","He went home.","He has a bike."],"answer":0,"exp":"kind, generous = sifat.","k":"44053dbe"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat mana yang mendeskripsikan penampilan?","options":["She is slim with short curly hair.","She loves reading.","She lives in Jakarta.","She was late."],"answer":0,"exp":"slim, curly hair = penampilan.","k":"be7065b2"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Kucing itu punya bulu yang lembut.\"","answer":"The cat has soft fur.","exp":"has + noun.","k":"4caf923c"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Taman itu penuh dengan bunga.\"","answer":"The park is full of flowers.","exp":"full of = penuh dengan.","k":"6fec6905"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["fluffy","berbulu lebat"],["narrow","sempit"],["gloomy","suram"],["peaceful","tenang damai"]],"exp":"Kosakata deskripsi.","k":"7b2a7d86"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"It has a long tail","options":["Ia punya ekor panjang","Ia punya kaki panjang","Ia punya telinga besar","Ia tidak punya ekor"],"answer":0,"exp":"tail = ekor.","k":"adb67e56"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"The room is clean and cozy","options":["Kamar itu bersih dan nyaman","Kamar itu kotor","Kamar itu sempit","Kamar itu gelap"],"answer":0,"exp":"cozy = nyaman.","k":"01be0ec2"}],"quiz":[{"type":"mcq","q":"Tujuan descriptive text adalah...","options":["menceritakan kejadian lampau","menggambarkan ciri-ciri orang, tempat, atau benda","memberi petunjuk langkah demi langkah","membujuk pembaca"],"answer":1,"exp":"Descriptive text menggambarkan ciri-ciri.","k":"31f7046f"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kalimat \"Lake Toba is located in North Sumatra\" termasuk bagian...","options":["Description","Identification","Re-orientation","Events"],"answer":1,"exp":"Memperkenalkan objek dan letaknya → Identification.","k":"0a76e4a3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih urutan kata sifat yang benar.","options":["a red big car","a big red car","a car big red","a big car red"],"answer":1,"exp":"size → color.","k":"09eca2b3"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["The soup taste delicious.","The soup tastes delicious.","The soup is taste delicious.","The soup tasting delicious."],"answer":1,"exp":"The soup (it) → tastes.","k":"13646171"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ibuku punya mata cokelat.","q":"My mother ___ brown eyes.","answers":["has"],"hint":"has / have ?","exp":"My mother (she) → has.","k":"ba39a1dd"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pasar itu ramai pada hari Minggu.","q":"The market ___ crowded on Sundays.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are ?","exp":"The market (it) → is.","k":"489e5477"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Dia mempunyai tas kulit hitam kecil.\"","answer":"She has a small black leather bag.","exp":"size → color → material.","k":"a2fb7033"},{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan kata sifat dengan artinya:","pairs":[["spacious","luas"],["scenic","indah pemandangannya"],["generous","murah hati"],["lightweight","ringan"]],"exp":"Kata sifat yang sering muncul dalam deskripsi tempat dan benda.","k":"5d6cca3a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"He is tall and thin and he has short curly hair","options":["Dia tinggi dan kurus, rambutnya pendek keriting","Dia pendek dan gemuk, rambutnya panjang","Dia tinggi, rambutnya panjang lurus","Dia kurus, rambutnya botak"],"answer":0,"exp":"short curly hair = rambut pendek keriting.","k":"9689f7bc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana yang merupakan kalimat deskripsi sifat orang?","options":["She went to the market yesterday.","She is friendly and diligent.","First, mix the flour.","I will visit Bali next year."],"answer":1,"exp":"Kalimat tentang sifat memakai is + kata sifat.","k":"6d48d22d"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata kerja \"looks\" dalam \"He looks tired\" berarti...","options":["melihat","tampak","mencari","menonton"],"answer":1,"exp":"look + kata sifat = tampak.","k":"fd13bd95"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Mana kalimat yang lebih deskriptif?","options":["It is a nice place.","It is a scenic place with a clear blue lake and fresh air.","I like it